(Today through Wednesday)
Issued at 1037 AM PDT Fri Jul 24 2026

Moderate to fresh northwest breezes with strong to near gale-foce
gusts will continue through the weekend. Moderate wind driven
seas will also prevail, resulting in potentially hazardous boating
